{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "b87974d4-de01-893b-9217-fbd1f5342a6a",
  "created_at": "2026-03-10T18:16:37-04:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Public Works",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Theresa Grasso",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Lorraine Medeiros",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-10T18:09:42-04:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Public Works storm line, this is Lorraine."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-10T18:09:46-04:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Hi, yes, hi. I know it's after hours, City Hall's closed, I saw the sign said to call this number for water problems. Is this the right one?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-10T18:09:59-04:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "It is, yes. This line stays open in the evening for storm and drainage issues. What's going on?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-10T18:10:08-04:00",
      "duration": 23,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "So the low spot at the end of my block, it's under water. Like a foot, easy. It's still sitting there from the rain, the rain Friday into Saturday, that was three days ago and it hasn't gone down, and, um, hold on one second. [pause] No, put that down, honey. Sorry. Sorry."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-10T18:10:31-04:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That's all right, take your time. A foot of water, you said, at the end of your block. Can you give me the address?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-10T18:10:42-04:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Four seventy-four Broadway. In the North End. The dip is just past my place, toward the corner, where the road kind of sags down."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-10T18:10:53-04:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, four seventy-four Broadway, North End, and the water is at the low spot just down from the house. Is it in the road itself?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-10T18:11:05-04:00",
      "duration": 26,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "In the road, yeah, across the whole thing pretty much. And the cars are, they're slowing to a crawl going through it. Some of them stop and sit there deciding whether to go. People are honking, and one guy tried to back up, and I'm just, I mean it's the dinner hour, it's wall to wall right now and"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-10T18:11:31-04:00",
      "duration": 1,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Mm-hm."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-10T18:11:32-04:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "and, no, you already had your milk. Sorry. Where was I."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-10T18:11:38-04:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Cars crawling through it, some stopping. Is the water coming up out of a drain, or is it just pooling?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-10T18:11:47-04:00",
      "duration": 15,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I don't know, I can't tell. There's a grate there but it's under the water. I just know it's not draining. It's been three days. The sun was out yesterday and nothing."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-10T18:12:02-04:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Understood. Has it gotten into any yards or houses that you can see?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-10T18:12:08-04:00",
      "duration": 18,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Not mine, it's not in my yard yet. It's up on the edge of the curb though. I'm just, I'm tired of it, honestly. Every time it rains this happens and everybody just drives through and nobody does anything about it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-10T18:12:26-04:00",
      "duration": 16,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I hear you. So I'll write this up for the crew as standing water in the roadway, not draining, about a foot deep, with traffic backing up. Let me make sure I have your name."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-10T18:12:42-04:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Theresa Grasso. G-R-A-S-S-O."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-10T18:12:44-04:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Theresa Grasso, G-R-A-S-S-O. And a callback number?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-10T18:12:48-04:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Four oh one, five five five, oh one five seven."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-10T18:12:53-04:00",
      "duration": 20,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Four oh one, five five five, oh one five seven. Got it. And my question back is, you asked who to call, and this is the right place, so you've done that. I'm going to send this to the crew supervisor in the morning."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-10T18:13:13-04:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "In the morning? It's a foot of water. Somebody's going to wreck a car in there tonight, it's getting dark and you can't see how deep it is."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-10T18:13:26-04:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Let me see if there's an on-call person I can flag it to tonight. Can you hold for just a moment?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-10T18:13:36-04:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yeah, okay, I'll hold."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-10T18:13:39-04:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Thank you. One moment."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-10T18:13:42-04:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "[pause] Hello? Hello?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-10T18:13:44-04:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Hello, Mrs. Grasso? Can you hear me?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-10T18:13:48-04:00",
      "duration": 1,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Hello?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-10T18:13:49-04:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I'm here. Hello?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-10T18:13:51-04:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "[line breaks up] Hello?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-10T18:13:54-04:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Hello? Hello?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-10T18:13:56-04:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Hello, hi, I'm so sorry, my phone just went dead, I think the kid hit the cord, or the base, I don't know. I'm so sorry about that."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-10T18:14:09-04:00",
      "duration": 15,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No problem at all. I'm glad you called back on the same line. I was just about to ring you at the number you gave me. I did reach the on-call person."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-10T18:14:24-04:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. And?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-10T18:14:26-04:00",
      "duration": 17,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "They're going to send someone out to look at it this evening, to check the drain and put out a sign or a barrier if it needs one. Then a crew will follow up on clearing it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-10T18:14:43-04:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "This evening, like tonight tonight?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-10T18:14:46-04:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That's what I was told, yes. I can't give you a time on it. They have other calls from the weekend rain too."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-10T18:14:57-04:00",
      "duration": 15,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Right, right, I'm sure. Everybody's got one. It's just that it's, I mean it's been three days. If it was the nice part of town they'd have had a truck there Sunday."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-10T18:15:12-04:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I understand why it feels that way. I've got it noted that it's been there since the rain ended Saturday, and that it's still not draining."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-10T18:15:24-04:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes. Saturday. It never went down."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-10T18:15:28-04:00",
      "duration": 20,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Good. So to read it back: four seventy-four Broadway, standing water about a foot deep at the low spot at the end of the block, across the road, traffic crawling, not draining since Saturday. Callback is four oh one, five five five, oh one five seven."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-10T18:15:48-04:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That's it, yeah. That's right."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-10T18:15:51-04:00",
      "duration": 15,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "If it gets worse tonight, say it starts coming toward houses, or someone's car stalls in it, call this line back right away. And if there's any danger to someone, call nine-one-one."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-10T18:16:06-04:00",
      "duration": 14,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. I just want somebody to come look at it. That's all I'm asking, really. Because I've been, honey, no, not now. I've been calling about, well, you know. It's fine."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-10T18:16:20-04:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I've got it logged tonight, so it's on record. You did the right thing calling."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-10T18:16:27-04:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. Thank you, Lorraine. I'm sorry, I have to go, somebody's, okay, thank you."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-10T18:16:34-04:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Take care, Mrs. Grasso. Goodnight."
    }
  ],
